sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant B as 组件（按钮 / 开关）
    participant M as FluThemeManager
    participant W as FluWindow / FluFrame
    participant C as 子组件

    U->>B: 点击"切换主题"
    B->>M: mode("dark")
    M->>W: window.theme(mode="dark")
    W->>W: 自身重绘
    M->>C: 遍历直接子组件 → theme(mode="dark")
    C->>C: 换配色字典 → _draw()
    C-->>W: 嵌套容器再由 update_children() 向下传播
